SUMMARY:Community Forum: Summer Connection & What’s Ahead
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nAfter celebrating five amazing years toget
 her at our AVL Digital Nomads birthday party\, we’re gathering **virtual
 ly** to reconnect\, look ahead\, and keep the spirit of community moving i
 nto the summer.\n\nThis gathering will be a mix of intentional connection 
 and conversation\, along with community updates\, upcoming events\, collab
 oration opportunities\, and ways to get more plugged in throughout the sum
 mer. It’s also an **opportunity to hear what members of the community ar
 e excited to create\, contribute to\, or experience moving forward** so id
 eas can be shared\, connections can happen\, and community-led experiences
  can continue to grow naturally.\n\nThink of it as part community check-in
 \, part summer kickoff\, and part open conversation with people who genuin
 ely want to see each other thrive.\n\nWhether you’re new\, have been aro
 und for years\, or simply want to reconnect\, this is a warm and easy spac
 e to drop in\, meet people\, and stay connected this summer.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/314773719/
